# This is the DUMPS repository. Only the small text files belong in git here.
# The memory images themselves live as encrypted 7z assets on each GitHub *release*,
# never in the git tree. This list makes sure a stray image can never be committed.
*.vmem
*.vmss
*.vmsn
*.vmdk
*.raw
*.mem
*.dmp
*.7z
*.7z.*
*.zip
*.exe
*.dll
